Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.63,0:00:04.28,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Tomorrow's the day we finally shoot \NMasaki and Yuki's intro video!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.28,0:00:09.24,Default,Live,0,0,0,,So today is a strategy meeting for \NMayoPan's immediate future!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.24,0:00:10.35,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Masaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.35,0:00:11.24,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.24,0:00:12.95,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\c&H313131&\frz351\fax0.2\pos(477.5,62)}Video Reveal
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.24,0:00:12.95,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\c&H313131&\fax0.2\frz347\pos(212,78)\u1}Shigeyuki
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.24,0:00:12.95,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\c&H313131&\fax0.25\fscx90\frz343.6\pos(170,141.5)}Announce New Member Addition!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.24,0:00:12.95,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\c&H313131&\fax0.2\frz344.8\pos(183,216.5)}Who could it be?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.58,0:00:12.95,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Listen up, folks!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.95,0:00:15.69,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,We have one month left \Nuntil Mother's deadline!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.95,0:00:19.45,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\c&H313131&\fs12\pos(397,24.5)}One month left!!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.95,0:00:20.20,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\c&H313131&\fs12\pos(158,33.5)}Masaki   {\u1}Masakichi\N{\u0\s1}Shige{\s0}yuki\NDone
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.95,0:00:20.20,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\c&H313131&\fs12\pos(294.5,-1)}Video Reveal
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.69,0:00:17.41,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,The numbers are against us,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.41,0:00:19.45,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,but with Yuki joining, they'll skyrocket!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.20,0:00:22.20,Default,Live,0,0,0,,And we've got Masaki on board, as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.20,0:00:23.33,Default,Live,0,0,0,,To the moon!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.08,0:00:27.24,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,W-Well, it's a little soon to say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.24,0:00:30.92,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,But via collabs or whatever it takes, \Nwe'll inch our way to a million subs!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.92,0:00:31.59,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,And!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.59,0:00:33.34,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Right before the deadline...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.34,0:00:37.60,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,A 100-hour nonstop livestream \Nwith MayoPan's channel on the line!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.09,0:00:37.60,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,1)\fs40\bord3\shad2\fnArial Black\3c&H872270&\4c&H872270&\c&H872270&\pos(320,123)}100-{\c&HB561D4&}Hour {\c&H8A0EF0&}Nonstop {\c&H39D2F2&}Livestream
Dialogue: 1,0:00:35.09,0:00:37.60,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,1)\fs40\bord1.5\fnArial Black\3c&HFDF0FD&s\c&H39D2F2&\pos(320,123)}100-{\c&HB561D4&}Hour {\c&H8A0EF0&}Nonstop {\c&H39D2F2&}Livestream
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.60,0:00:39.60,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Aw, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.60,0:00:40.60,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Question, Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.60,0:00:42.35,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Yes, what is it, Live-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.35,0:00:46.19,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Sensei, do you have any ideas for things \Nyou want to do on the livestream?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.81,0:00:49.48,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,You bet I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.48,0:00:52.40,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,For example, "Going Thru \NEvery Drive-Thru" is a must!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.40,0:00:54.82,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Then there's "Bread-Eating Bungee Jumping," \Nand also... Also...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.82,0:00:56.65,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,I can smell the jackpot already!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.65,0:00:58.82,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,She sure is fired up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.96,0:01:04.26,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,It's time for the big climax on our road \Nto reach one million subscribers!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.26,0:01:06.62,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Let's kick it up one last time!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.27,0:01:09.38,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Hey, c'mon, Shige!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.73,0:01:13.12,Default,Live,0,0,0,,You're one of us now, \Nso try and join in for times like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.12,0:01:14.10,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,The comments.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.10,0:01:14.89,Default,Live,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.89,0:01:15.88,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,The comments.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.39,0:01:17.89,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,They're utter chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.24,0:01:19.14,Default,Group,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.70,0:01:20.55,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.55,0:01:22.81,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFBFEFB&\c&H797C79&\pos(332.5,23)}Ruka  {\c&HBFC0BD&}1 day ago\N{\c&H6B6E6B&}Is Masakichi really involved with them?\N\N{\c&HDD9795&}5 replies\N\N{\c&H656866&}Delhi Amano  {\c&HBFC0BD&}1 day ago\N{\c&H6B6E6B&}Masakichi? Who's that?
