Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.45,0:03:07.58,Signs_EpTitle,Sign,0,0,0,,{\3c&H6192AA&}Announcement: Gone Missing
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.46,0:03:08.53,DefaultItalics,Kikka,0,0,0,,And so, since we happened to run into her,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.53,0:03:11.96,DefaultItalics,Kikka,0,0,0,,we ended up going drinking \Nwith Masakichi herself!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.27,0:03:13.90,DefaultItalics,Otomi,0,0,0,,She hasn't changed at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.90,0:03:14.93,DefaultItalics,Kikka,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.93,0:03:19.12,DefaultItalics,Group,0,0,0,,But the truth is, we managed to...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.01,0:03:20.63,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(230,1)\fs16\bord2\shad1\fnArial Black\c&H8B58E6&\3c&H8B58E6&\pos(320.5,106.5)\4c&H7A7CAA&}Managed to Bury the Hatchet!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:19.01,0:03:20.63,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(230,1)\fs16\bord1\fnArial Black\c&H8B58E6&\3c&HDDC9FA&\pos(320.5,106.5)}Managed to Bury the Hatchet!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.12,0:03:20.63,DefaultItalics,Group,0,0,0,,bury the hatchet!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.82,0:03:23.01,DefaultItalics,Otomi,0,0,0,,Okay, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.01,0:03:25.37,DefaultItalics,Otomi,0,0,0,,With this, we're even \Nfor everything that's happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.37,0:03:26.68,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,Come at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.68,0:03:27.39,DefaultItalics,Otomi,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.94,0:03:29.80,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,You've done it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.80,0:03:30.78,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,Now it's {\i0}my{\i1} turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.78,0:03:31.93,DefaultItalics,Otomi,0,0,0,,Don't hold back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.93,0:03:33.37,DefaultItalics,Otomi,0,0,0,,Hit me with all you've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.64,0:03:33.75,DefaultItalicsTop,Masaki,0,0,0,,Hi-yah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.92,0:03:36.62,DefaultItalics,Otomi,0,0,0,,That hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.10,0:03:41.12,DefaultItalics,Otomi,0,0,0,,Man, she's way too strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.12,0:03:46.99,DefaultItalics,Kikka,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, Masakichi said she's working \Nfor the Mayonaka Punch channel now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.41,0:03:49.29,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs12\pos(379.5,14)}barnacle\NTime heals all wounds? Not in my book.\N\Nnico\NMayonaka Punch is the group that took part\Nin TSUMA FES, right? How are they connected?\N\NLonely Oedo Girl\NThis video confirmed my belief that\NHype-Sis is better off without Masakichi.\N\NBuddha\NOtomin, you should sue that woman.\NAnd why didn't Kikka stop her?\N\Nsaku-666\NPast scandals from the violent Masakichi here:\N{\c&HC59688&}Hyped-Up Sisters' Masakichi Punches Member\Non Stream, Earns Label of Violent Woman\N\N{\c&H535359&}Hojicha Ice Cream\NSo angry seeing Masakichi after all this time...\NShe's a genius at offending people.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.99,0:03:49.29,DefaultItalics,Otomi,0,0,0,,That's right! Masakichi's working hard—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.29,0:03:50.33,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,184)\fs30\fnComic Sans MS\c&HFFFDFF&\3c&H746968&\4c&H746968&\bord2\shad1}Trending {\c&H746968&\3c&HFFFDFF&}NewTuber {\c&HFFFDFF&\3c&H746968&}Gossip
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.29,0:03:50.33,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,184)\q2\fs16\an7\c&H9D9B8C&\pos(11.5,218)}Hyped-Up Sisters' Masakichi Punches Member on Stream, Earns Label of Violent Woman
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.29,0:03:50.33,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,184)\q2\fs16\an7\c&H9D9B8C&\pos(15.5,306.5)}Violent Outburst 1: Hits Member with Fist to the Face on Stream
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.16,0:03:53.40,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't clip just that part!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.42,0:03:54.92,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,353)\c&H5C5F5D&\3c&HF3F6F3&\pos(302.5,29)}Mio @ Outside Girl\N\N{\c&HAAADAA&}I went to see an event for my faves,\Nand I ended up violently attacked\Nby a staff member.\N\NShe was a woman, but she chased me down\Nat full speed and started hurling insults...\N\NWhen I argued back, she suddenly punched\Nme in the face, and it was so scary... (The\Nswelling didn't go down for about a week)\N\NI can't believe she turned out to be\NMasakichi-san... There's something wrong\Nwith Mayonaka Punch as a group
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.51,0:03:57.84,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Huh?! What's this photo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.03,0:04:03.18,Default,Live,0,0,0,,The only one who could have \Ntaken this photo is...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.18,0:04:07.30,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\c&HF8F4C7&\fs30\move(346.5,89,378,29,21,4108)\t(\fsp6)}Staaaare...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.07,0:04:28.33,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(310,24)}Kikka\NDid you see the video we just put up??\NIf you haven't, watch it now!\N\NKikka\NMasaki!!!\N\NKikka\NSo sorry
