Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.83,0:04:30.58,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(310,24)}Otomi\NThis isn't good ;w;\N\NOtomi\NReally sorry\N\NKikka\NDid you see the video we just put up??\NIf you haven't, watch it now!\N\NKikka\NMasaki!!!\N\NKikka\NSo sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.58,0:04:31.58,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(310,24)}Kikka\NWe'll upload an apology vid right away,\Nso call after you've watched it!\N\NOtomi\NThis isn't good ;w;\N\NOtomi\NReally sorry\N\NKikka\NDid you see the video we just put up??\NIf you haven't, watch it now!\N\NKikka\NMasaki!!!\N\NKikka\NSo sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.92,0:04:34.01,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I've made up my mind to be on camera!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.01,0:04:35.46,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,This doesn't faze me at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.46,0:04:39.71,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos(386.5,11.5)}Lazy Bear\N\NI just wanted to watch a MayoPan video...\NWhat's with all the trolls ;w;\NWho's Masakichi-san?\NCut it out, seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.49,0:04:41.21,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,"So what if she's involved?!"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.21,0:04:41.42,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(326.5,45)}Sweet Potato\NI like MayoPan, and I have nothing against\NMasakichi, but something feels wrong in\Nthe way she's hiding behind the scenes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.42,0:04:42.21,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(326.5,45)}Mayonaka Punch\NSo what if she's involved?!\N\NSweet Potato\NI like MayoPan, and I have nothing against\NMasakichi, but something feels wrong in\Nthe way she's hiding behind the scenes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.82,0:04:44.30,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Who posted this comment?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.30,0:04:46.30,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,83)}tomtom\Nthere really is something wrong with her\N\NFifth Champion Tanaka\NIs that Masakichi herself...?\N\Nunnown\NJust because a viewer\Nwas a little bit critical...\N\Nzack\Nis the official account lashing out?? lmao\N\NMayonaka Punch\NSo what if she's involved?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.54,0:04:48.30,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I-It's not me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.30,0:04:49.94,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Must be them!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.94,0:04:53.25,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,"All of us members love Masakichi-san."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.57,0:04:54.14,DefaultTop,Live,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.25,0:04:54.14,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Tokage-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.14,0:04:54.77,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(341.5,57.5)}tomtom\Nthere really is something wrong with her
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.77,0:04:55.39,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(341.5,57.5)}Mayonaka Punch\NAll of us members love Masakichi-san\N\Ntomtom\Nthere really is something wrong with her
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.39,0:04:56.40,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.90,0:05:06.12,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Doesn't faze me at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.24,0:05:08.55,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.10,0:05:23.10,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,That's a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.14,0:05:27.18,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I'm not fine in the least.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.94,0:05:36.10,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Ah, Masaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.06,0:05:40.05,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.05,0:05:42.57,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Let's hold off a little longer \Non having me in a video.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.57,0:05:44.18,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.18,0:05:45.78,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Well, because...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.78,0:05:47.74,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,It's because of this, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.74,0:05:51.48,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Th-That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.48,0:05:54.22,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,They all say they don't want to see me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.22,0:05:57.81,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,If I show up now, MayoPan as a whole \Nmight end up a target.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.81,0:05:59.63,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,That's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.02,0:05:59.63,DefaultTop,Tokage,0,0,0,,Who cares about that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.63,0:06:03.21,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,I'll fight back against \Nall the hate comments we get!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.12,0:06:06.90,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,But there {\i1}is{\i0} some tooth to what Tokage said!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.90,0:06:07.78,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.78,0:06:09.82,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,You should do what you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.82,0:06:10.84,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,So let's shoot...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.84,0:06:11.39,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Listen here—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.39,0:06:12.01,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Just do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.44,0:06:13.14,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.49,0:06:15.27,Default,Live,0,0,0,,You've finally decided to be on camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.27,0:06:17.14,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Like I said, it's too risky—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.14,0:06:18.80,Default,Live,0,0,0,,So when {\i1}will{\i0} you do it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.80,0:06:21.38,Default,Live,0,0,0,,We only have a month left!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.38,0:06:22.48,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.53,0:06:27.04,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I'll do it! I'll be on camera!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.04,0:06:28.41,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Someday, that is!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.41,0:06:30.81,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,So until then, I'll be behind \Nthe camera like always—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.81,0:06:31.95,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Someday?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.95,0:06:33.45,Default,Live,0,0,0,,That means you won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.45,0:06:35.36,Default,Live,0,0,0,,You're running away!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.36,0:06:37.20,Default,Live,0,0,0,,From your own feelings!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.20,0:06:39.58,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What the hell would {\i1}you{\i0} know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.58,0:06:41.94,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I know everything about you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.94,0:06:42.73,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.73,0:06:44.29,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Are you a mind-reader now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.29,0:06:45.41,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,You're just a vampire!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.41,0:06:47.93,Default,Live,0,0,0,,No! I'm not just a vampire!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.93,0:06:51.34,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I'm the vampire who knows you \Nbetter than anyone else!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.34,0:06:53.55,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Ah! I've had it up to here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.72,0:06:55.74,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Wait right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.74,0:06:56.35,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,No, thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.35,0:06:58.09,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.09,0:06:59.23,Default,Live,0,0,0,,We're about to start filming—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.23,0:07:00.25,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Shut up already!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.25,0:07:01.66,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I'm sick of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.66,0:07:03.36,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Go away, you stupid bat!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.83,0:07:05.70,Default,Live,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.11,0:07:07.76,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.76,0:07:10.68,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,What about hitting a million subs?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.16,0:07:13.22,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,You still have videos saved up, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.22,0:07:14.35,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I mean, sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.35,0:07:17.86,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,But once we run out, it'll be nothing \Nbut Yuki-sama's gaming commentary!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.86,0:07:20.02,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,That'd be hell on earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.69,0:07:23.29,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I'll come back once things have calmed down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.29,0:07:24.24,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.24,0:07:25.16,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.16,0:07:26.25,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Maybe!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.19,0:07:31.18,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,What now, Live-sama?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.62,0:07:35.35,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Live-sama? Live-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.85,0:07:38.46,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I remember now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.89,0:07:47.00,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,Man, I'm such a loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.18,0:07:51.28,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,Letting those measly comments get to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.87,0:07:53.87,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,I haven't changed at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.04,0:08:04.04,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord2.5\c&H959FA1&\3c&HFCFFFC&\pos(484.5,98)}Mayonaka Punch\N{\fs20\c&HFCFFFC&\3c&HEA8DE9&\fs16}710k subscribers\N{\c&H959FA1&\3c&HFCFFFC&\fs12}Good morning from the dead of night!\N{\c&HE558B2&\3c&HF3D8EA&\fs14}Subscribed
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.29,0:08:09.05,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Ah! Don't think about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.12,0:08:17.80,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,Don't think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.03,0:08:21.66,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,Don't think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.14,0:08:29.19,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,Don't think... about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.69,0:08:36.65,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,Don't think, don't think, don't think...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.59,0:08:39.95,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,Don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.95,0:08:41.95,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(29.5,22.5)\c&HD291D1&\3c&HEFC9DF&}Lonely Oedo Girl\N{\c&H826476&}I saw the same thing back in the\NHype-Sis days. Masakichi sure\Nloves reusing old ideas lmao
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.95,0:08:41.95,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HEFC9DF&\pos(191,94)\3c&HE02E96&}Comment
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.95,0:08:44.21,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs40\c&HEF6CEC&\fax-0.15\frz343.2\move(447,154,339.26,102.06,29,2240)}Lonely Oedo Girl
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.49,0:08:45.58,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,N-No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.58,0:08:48.35,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,She's the one always leaving awful comments!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.62,0:08:46.58,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(280,1)\q2\pos(268.5,40)}Lonely Oedo Girl: Think about how the fans feel.\NHow about I punch you too??
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.63,0:08:47.58,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs22\fad(280,1)\q2\pos(295,136)}Lonely Oedo Girl: Eat ittttttttttttttt
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.87,0:08:54.91,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,She recognized me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.56,0:08:58.22,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,You definitely recognized me just now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.26,0:09:03.02,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,What, wanna fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.58,0:09:05.32,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,This is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.32,0:09:06.32,Default,Oedo Girl,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.81,0:09:08.44,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,A-All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.91,0:09:09.86,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Listen here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.86,0:09:12.29,Default,Oedo Girl,0,0,0,,Y-You're Masakichi-san, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.29,0:09:14.82,Default,Oedo Girl,0,0,0,,Oh, wow! I'm a huge fan!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.82,0:09:15.57,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.57,0:09:18.70,Default,Oedo Girl,0,0,0,,Y-You see, I watched you \Nall the time in the Hype-Sis days...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.70,0:09:20.94,Default,Oedo Girl,0,0,0,,C-Can I get a handshake?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.83,0:09:23.37,Default,Oedo Girl,0,0,0,,Oh! And a photo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.54,0:09:26.81,Default,Oedo Girl,0,0,0,,Thanks a bunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.05,0:09:29.83,Default,Oedo Girl,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.84,0:09:33.05,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What?! The hell was that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.37,0:09:35.30,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,She's nothing but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.40,0:09:39.09,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,S-Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.24,0:09:42.46,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,Whatever!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.46,0:09:43.58,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,I'm here to rest!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.58,0:09:45.08,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,So it's resting time!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.17,0:10:10.13,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(188,1)\fs40\fnComic Sans MS\c&H2B2B28&}One month left!!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.08,0:10:20.03,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I wonder how they're holding up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.84,0:10:22.27,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Just this once.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.27,0:10:24.39,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Just to check up on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.03,0:10:27.52,DefaultTop,Masaki,0,0,0,,Okay, they're still uploading.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.93,0:10:27.56,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(404,1)\c&H2F362F&\fs16\pos(393,336)}Live Has Gone Missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.93,0:10:27.68,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(404,137)\fnArial Black\c&HF2D6E5&\3c&H493A93&\4c&H18292C&\bord2\shad2\pos(320,101.5)}Gone Missing
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.52,0:10:28.89,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs40\fad(148,1)\fnArial Black\c&H18292C&\3c&H18292C&\4c&H18292C&\bord4\shad2\pos(332,25)}Gone Missing
Dialogue: 1,0:10:27.52,0:10:28.89,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs40\fad(148,1)\fnArial Black\c&HF2D6E5&\3c&H493A93&\bord2\pos(332,25)}Gone Missing
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.80,0:10:28.46,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.13,0:10:31.13,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.43,0:10:36.56,DefaultItalics,Fu,0,0,0,,Thank you for always \Ntuning in to Mayonaka Punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.56,0:10:38.90,DefaultItalics,Fu,0,0,0,,Today, we have an announcement to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.90,0:10:43.21,DefaultItalics,Fu,0,0,0,,The truth is, Mayonaka Punch's leader, \NLive, went missing a few days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.21,0:10:44.49,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,It's not about me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.49,0:10:46.14,DefaultItalicsTop,Tokage,0,0,0,,Anyway, here she is!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.14,0:10:48.75,DefaultItalicsTop,Tokage,0,0,0,,If you see her, shoot us a DM and stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.06,0:10:50.09,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What?! Why would {\i1}Live{\i0} go missing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.75,0:10:51.75,DefaultItalicsTop,Tokage,0,0,0,,She'll fork up a hefty reward for it, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.75,0:10:52.76,DefaultItalics,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Live-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.76,0:10:55.29,DefaultItalics,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I know you're out there watching this video!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.29,0:10:56.73,DefaultItalics,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Please come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.73,0:10:59.26,DefaultItalics,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Weren't we going to reach \Na million subs together?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.26,0:11:03.45,DefaultItalics,Fu,0,0,0,,Finally, we apologize for having \Nto release this video.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.45,0:11:08.14,DefaultItalics,Fu,0,0,0,,And we earnestly await \Nany information you may have.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.14,0:11:09.39,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs20\an7\pos(312,95)}If this face rings a bell,\Nplease reach out!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.14,0:11:09.39,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs20\an7\pos(312,260)}We welcome any and all information.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.14,0:11:09.39,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs20\an7\pos(320,328)}From all of us at Mayonaka Punch
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.39,0:11:10.59,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.59,0:11:12.76,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,This must be a prank, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.76,0:11:15.88,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,This video went live two days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.88,0:11:18.27,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,As for yesterday... No uploads?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.67,0:11:25.06,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,Fu... Ichiko... Tokage...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.66,0:11:28.84,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,Yuki... I don't have her number.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.16,0:11:31.47,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,How come no one's picking up?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.53,0:11:34.18,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Because it's morning?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.74,0:11:37.07,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,Man, I swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.07,0:11:39.67,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,They're still hopeless without me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.67,0:11:44.68,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs20\bord3\an7\c&HB8BCB9&\3c&HFBFEFB&}< {\c&HA889E6&}Live
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.67,0:11:44.68,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs20\bord3\an9\c&HFFFDFE&\3c&HA871EC&}What's up with that video?!\N\NIt's a joke, right?\N\N{\alpha&HFF&\t(29,612,\alpha&H00&)}Please answer\N\N{\alpha&HFF&\t(1238,2156,\alpha&H00&)}You didn't really go missing, did you?\N\N{\alpha&HFF&\t(3115,3532,\alpha&H00&)}Hey\N\N{\alpha&HFF&\t(4366,4700,\alpha&H00&)}Say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.97,0:11:44.68,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,A video like that with no punchline \Nwill have people think Live really went missing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.43,0:11:48.75,Flashback,Masaki,0,0,0,,Go away, you stupid bat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.66,0:11:52.78,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,You're kidding, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.11,0:11:57.10,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,It must be a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.10,0:12:00.28,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,I know Live wouldn't disappear \Non us just because of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.61,0:12:03.53,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,I'm sure she's relaxing \Nin the living room right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.01,0:12:06.43,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.97,0:12:10.66,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Huh? What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.66,0:12:13.62,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,What happened these last three days?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.79,0:12:23.84,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Hey! Is anyone here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.84,0:12:25.39,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.63,0:12:30.10,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Live's room...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.62,0:12:49.62,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs20\bord3\fnComic Sans MS\c&H2C2C2E&\3c&H5C5B5E&\pos(510,15.5)}To my beloved Live\NFrom Ai
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.62,0:12:49.62,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs20\bord3\fnComic Sans MS\c&H2C2C2E&\3c&H5C5B5E&\pos(314,15.5)}To my beloved Live\NFrom Ai
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.62,0:12:49.62,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs20\bord3\fnComic Sans MS\c&H2C2C2E&\3c&H5C5B5E&\pos(102.5,15.5)}To my beloved Live\NFrom Ai
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.12,0:12:56.88,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs30\bord3\fnComic Sans MS\c&H252525&\3c&H686769&\fax-0.15\move(316,91,315.3,-152.49,26,4739)\frz346.2}To my beloved Live\NFrom Ai
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.05,0:12:56.40,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,"To my beloved Live... from Ai"?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.73,0:12:59.48,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Twenty years old...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.48,0:13:01.55,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,This one, and this one...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.55,0:13:03.27,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,They're all from twenty years ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.16,0:13:08.04,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Live!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.39,0:13:29.49,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Hop inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.32,0:13:34.34,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.34,0:13:36.18,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.18,0:13:38.92,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,And why is Banpai Manor being torn down?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.92,0:13:41.59,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Didn't we still have \None month until the deadline?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.09,0:13:41.59,DefaultTop,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Calm down, Masaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.59,0:13:43.04,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,And who was {\i1}that?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.04,0:13:44.92,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,He was totally after me, wasn't he?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.92,0:13:45.48,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.48,0:13:47.86,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Hey, wait! Where are we going?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.86,0:13:49.76,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Say something already!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.42,0:13:53.07,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Settle down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.07,0:13:55.52,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Or we'll throw you out of the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.05,0:13:57.35,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Where should I start?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.02,0:13:59.27,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Is Live safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.93,0:14:01.16,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,We don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.52,0:14:04.45,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,We've all been looking for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.45,0:14:06.98,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,So she really went missing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.98,0:14:08.03,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.73,0:14:12.28,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Does this letter have anything to do with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.28,0:14:15.04,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs24\bord3\fnComic Sans MS\c&H1B1B16&\3c&H4E4D48&\frz23.85\fax0.1\pos(187,162.5)}To my beloved Live\NFrom Ai
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.78,0:14:15.04,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Who exactly {\i1}is{\i0} this Ai person?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.97,0:14:18.66,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Live-sama remembered everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.05,0:14:22.17,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Even after I hid away \Nall the letters and photos...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.02,0:14:24.12,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,So is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.09,0:14:32.41,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Who's {\i1}that{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.41,0:14:33.55,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.55,0:14:35.72,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Mother's minions trying to capture Live.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.72,0:14:37.22,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What? Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.22,0:14:40.85,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,It's against the vampire code \Nto go missing without any notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.14,0:14:45.69,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,If they get their hands on Live-sama, \Nwe'll never be able to see her again!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.69,0:14:48.53,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,We need to find her before Mother does!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.53,0:14:49.78,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.10,0:14:56.29,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,We've shaken them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.50,0:15:04.24,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,So, about this Ai person...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.92,0:15:06.61,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Ichiko, take the wheel!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.61,0:15:07.92,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Leave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.52,0:15:23.50,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I've had enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.07,0:15:28.25,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Masaki-san! Ichiko-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.25,0:15:29.38,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Fu!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.08,0:15:34.66,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Looks like you're all safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.66,0:15:35.84,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Yuki-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.84,0:15:37.31,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,We need to get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.31,0:15:39.36,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,They'll call for help in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.36,0:15:40.72,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,What about the car?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.72,0:15:42.57,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,It's not too far from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.57,0:15:43.93,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,We'll fly while avoiding their gaze.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.93,0:15:44.75,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.75,0:15:45.53,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.53,0:15:46.50,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Where are we headed?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.50,0:15:48.63,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,The site for MayoPan's livestream.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.63,0:15:50.32,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What? Stream?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.32,0:15:50.90,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.90,0:15:52.34,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I thought we were searching for Live!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.34,0:15:56.90,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Mother views Live's actions as a problem, \Nand she's issued a statement
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.90,0:15:59.10,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,moving up the deadline by one month.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.10,0:16:00.46,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,By one month?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.46,0:16:01.71,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,That means...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.71,0:16:04.23,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Today's the last day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.70,0:16:06.74,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,So that's why Banpai Manor...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.96,0:16:08.89,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Stop crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.89,0:16:11.14,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,It's too early for us to give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.14,0:16:11.61,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.02,0:16:14.85,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Mother only said the deadline \Nhad been moved up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.85,0:16:16.84,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,The original agreement still holds.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.33,0:16:21.24,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,If we can reach a million subscribers \Ntoday as we arranged...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.24,0:16:24.75,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,We'll be allowed to live as we have been!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.33,0:16:27.53,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,So you're holding a livestream?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.53,0:16:31.13,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I'm sure Live-sama will watch our stream!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.13,0:16:33.70,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,And when she does, she's sure to come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.70,0:16:35.26,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,That's why we need to do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.26,0:16:36.69,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.69,0:16:39.28,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Masaki-san, help us out with the stream!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.28,0:16:41.70,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Tokage's getting everything set up as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.70,0:16:43.67,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Tokage?! Why her—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.80,0:16:44.52,DefaultTop,Yuki,0,0,0,,Let's go. We don't have much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.97,0:16:46.55,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,We'll go over the details there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.02,0:16:50.07,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,312)\bord2\c&H9CA09D&\3c&HFCFFFC&\fscy70\pos(314,159.5)}Mayonaka Punch
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.02,0:16:50.07,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,312)\fs20\bord2\c&HFCFFFC&\3c&HEA82E7&\fscy70\fax0.15\pos(554,183.5)}710k subscribers
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.57,0:16:50.78,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,They've completely lost touch with reality!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.78,0:16:52.20,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,Besides...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.42,0:16:55.03,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Why here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.47,0:16:56.87,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,This is where...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.37,0:17:00.41,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,Live and I first met...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.94,0:17:04.44,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,This is the hospital where \NAi-san was admitted.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.85,0:17:15.29,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Seriously, what the hell's wrong here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.29,0:17:17.36,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,That's Tokage, and she sounds pissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.36,0:17:19.71,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Why am I still getting a black screen?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.71,0:17:21.81,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Things obviously aren't going well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.81,0:17:23.27,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,She really is such a handful!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.91,0:17:26.52,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,You don't have anything set up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.52,0:17:27.73,DefaultTop,Tokage,0,0,0,,Oh, Shigeyuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.24,0:17:28.52,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Masaki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.73,0:17:28.52,DefaultTop,Yuki,0,0,0,,Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.52,0:17:32.48,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Could you handle the switcher for the stream?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.48,0:17:35.28,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Please check all of the camera positions.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.28,0:17:36.10,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,I'll be off!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.35,0:17:39.42,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.83,0:17:41.53,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Um, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.53,0:17:43.88,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Live-sama left this in her room.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.29,0:17:47.51,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Um, I didn't... I didn't read what was inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.00,0:17:49.38,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,271)\fs24\bord3\fnComic Sans MS\c&H3D2B2B&\3c&H877475&\frz4.337\pos(305,118.5)}To Masaki\NFrom Live
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.05,0:17:52.50,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,She totally read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.66,0:18:01.01,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,One here, and here...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.01,0:18:04.27,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,Where did they get all these cameras?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.78,0:18:18.78,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs30\bord2\fnTimes New Roman\c&H4F5032&\3c&HBFC8B1&\move(504.5,80,381.5,80,23,2984)}Ai-sama
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.17,0:18:35.21,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Live...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.80,0:18:45.93,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,How did you even manage to make this mess?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.22,0:18:47.38,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,For crying out loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.38,0:18:48.24,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,How are we on time?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.24,0:18:50.75,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,It's almost time for us to go live.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.75,0:18:52.11,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Oh, Masaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.43,0:18:53.58,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Good timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.58,0:18:54.61,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,We need to hurry and—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.99,0:18:55.08,DefaultTop,Masaki,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.65,0:18:59.61,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Ai passed away in this hospital \Ntwenty years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.61,0:19:04.42,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,And Live slept for twenty years, \Nforgetting about that person.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.84,0:19:06.12,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.37,0:19:10.86,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,In that case, she must be trying \Nto do the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.86,0:19:11.62,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.62,0:19:14.84,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,It said, "I'm going to sleep for a while."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.84,0:19:18.20,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,She's trying to fall into another deep sleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.20,0:19:19.17,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Masaki-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.17,0:19:21.49,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Last time, she slept for twenty years!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.49,0:19:23.76,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,This time around, it might be even longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.76,0:19:25.40,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.40,0:19:28.09,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Well, if she doesn't wake up, \Njust smack her real good on the head—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.09,0:19:30.41,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Nothing you tried could wake her up, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.89,0:19:33.49,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,She'll end up forgetting everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.49,0:19:36.25,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,About Ai, and me as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.25,0:19:38.67,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Live-sama would never forget about you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.67,0:19:40.57,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Then why does the end of her letter...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.57,0:19:42.57,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\fnComic Sans MS\c&H3E2011&\frz9.441\pos(232.5,264.5)}Farewell
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.57,0:19:42.57,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,say "farewell"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.89,0:19:45.24,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,If it's all true, then now's \Nnot the time for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.24,0:19:46.58,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,We need to look for her!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.29,0:19:48.53,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Please wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.53,0:19:49.58,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.06,0:19:51.12,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I won't allow it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.12,0:19:53.24,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Not if I have anything to say about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.24,0:19:55.24,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I don't know anything about Ai,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.24,0:19:57.77,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,but leaving me behind \Nto go off all by herself...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.77,0:19:58.84,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Wasn't she the one...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.89,0:20:02.32,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,who said she'd be there for me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.32,0:20:03.59,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Snap out of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.04,0:20:07.47,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,We've already searched for\N Live to no success.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.47,0:20:09.60,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,You think you can do any better?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.10,0:20:13.10,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Focus on doing what you can right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.57,0:20:15.55,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Masaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.44,0:20:18.10,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Live-sama will come back to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.10,0:20:21.36,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,And we'll hit a million subs \Nto save Banpai Manor!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.36,0:20:24.24,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Everything will go back to the way it was!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.69,0:20:31.32,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,We need to start the stream soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.86,0:20:36.38,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,It makes no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.38,0:20:38.11,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,Something's not right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.59,0:20:40.08,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,Not to mention...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.08,0:20:43.02,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,There's no way we can get \N300k subs in one night.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.75,0:20:48.03,DefaultItalics,Tokage,0,0,0,,We've got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.03,0:20:48.84,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.84,0:20:54.23,DefaultItalics,Tokage,0,0,0,,We've come up with a special plan \Nto get us subs like crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.66,0:20:56.17,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Tokage...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.05,0:21:01.49,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,That smug grin of yours \Nworries me the most here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.49,0:21:02.44,DefaultItalics,Fu,0,0,0,,Masaki-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.44,0:21:03.36,DefaultItalics,Fu,0,0,0,,We're counting on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.43,0:21:06.03,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Fine! To hell with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.03,0:21:08.78,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs28\fnArial Black\pos(320,4)\3c&HF9FAF7&\bord3.5\shad3\c&HF9FAF7&\4c&H701A77&}Mayonaka Punch\NEmergency Livestream!!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:07.03,0:21:08.78,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs28\fnArial Black\c&H9A28E9&\pos(320,4)\3c&H8B0E67&\bord1.5}M{\c&HDD1B9F&}a{\c&HF0FAFB&}y{\c&H9A28E9&}o{\c&HDD1B9F&}n{\c&HF0FAFB&}a{\c&H9A28E9&}k{\c&HDD1B9F&}a {\c&HF0FAFB&}P{\c&H9A28E9&}u{\c&HDD1B9F&}n{\c&HF0FAFB&}c{\c&H9A28E9&}h\N{\c&H5209E4&}Emergency {\c&HF0FAFB&}Livestream!!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.14,0:21:11.40,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Good morning from the dead of night!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.40,0:21:12.73,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Mayonaka Punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.73,0:21:13.34,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Fu.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.34,0:21:14.21,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Ichiko!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.21,0:21:15.61,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Tokage!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.61,0:21:17.09,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Yukirinko!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.09,0:21:22.26,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Thank you for tuning in to the \NMayonaka Punch emergency livestream.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.26,0:21:27.47,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,To get right to the point, \Nwe have something to tell all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.47,0:21:29.29,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Um, go ahead, Ichiko-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.29,0:21:30.10,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.53,0:21:33.93,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Actually... We're vampires!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.93,0:21:35.09,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.09,0:21:35.71,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.71,0:21:37.18,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,You're admitting it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.18,0:21:38.44,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,But... what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.78,0:21:40.30,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.30,0:21:42.19,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,No, don't give me that thumbs-up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.19,0:21:44.11,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(340,20)}Engawa: Good morning~\Nwww.jp: where's little miss violent?!\NFried Mackerel Meal: Where's Live?\NMii: Good morning, MayoPan!\N...This feels kind of serious.\NRural HS Senior: What?\NgomadanGO: ??????\NPastel Blue: Vampires???\NYuuna: ?!\NMii: What?\Nmolasses: what's this now lol a joke?\NChai_T: the channel's suddenly\Ngone all occult lolol\NFried Mackerel Meal: Forget that,\Ndid you find Live-sama yet???\NGreen Turtle: You can't be serious lol
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.02,0:21:49.56,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What's happening?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.29,0:21:54.43,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,How is this livestream going to end?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.55,0:23:27.26,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,MayoPan's all-or-nothing livestream...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.26,0:23:28.30,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,How will it all end?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.30,0:23:30.05,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,To sum it up, Ichiko turns \Ninto Super Ichiko-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.05,0:23:30.84,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,I want to sing!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.84,0:23:32.76,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,The final episode: \N"Tokage's Never-Ending Jackp—
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.93,0:23:34.30,DefaultTop,Yuki,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Yukirinko's world-famous now!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.30,0:23:35.60,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Seriously, how's it end?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.60,0:23:37.56,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Next time: "The Last Live Stream"!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.56,0:23:39.98,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Live, hurry up and come back!
